- P15: CONTRACT (Toolbox.Core.Workspaces, WorkspacePack.cs): `WorkspacePackSelection { List<string> ToolIds, ProfileIds, StackIds, CustomIds; Dictionary<string,string> Reasons; string WhyPulled(kind,id); bool IsEmpty }` - kind = "tool"|"profile"|"custom" (hằng WorkspacePackSelection.ToolKey/ProfileKey/CustomKey); Reasons chỉ có mục được kéo theo.
- P15: CONTRACT: `WorkspacePack.Resolve(Workspace ws, WorkspacePackSelection sel)` -> selection mở rộng (+Reasons); `WorkspacePack.Preview(ws, ToolStore library, sel)` -> `WorkspacePackPreview { Selection(đã Resolve), ToolCount, ProfileCount, StackCount, CustomCount, List<string> Warnings }`; `WorkspacePack.ToolsOf(library, resolved)`, `BuildData(ws, library, resolved, warnings)` -> `WorkspacePackData` (manifest.Workspace: bindings{toolId,name,args}, customs, profiles, stacks, requiredKinds).
- P15: CONTRACT: `Packer.PackWorkspace(Workspace ws, ToolStore library, WorkspacePackSelection sel, string zipPath)` -> WorkspacePackPreview (tự Resolve; ném ArgumentException nếu rỗng). `PackManifest.Workspace` là trường tuỳ chọn, FormatVersion giữ 1 (gói cũ vẫn đọc/nhập).
- P15: CONTRACT: `PackageImporter.ImportIntoWorkspace(ToolStore store, Workspace ws, string zipPath, string destRoot, IDictionary<string,ConflictResolution> toolChoices, ConflictResolution itemConflict = KeepBoth)` -> `WorkspaceImportResult { Tools, BindingsAdded, CustomsAdded, ProfilesAdded, StacksAdded, ToolMap, Warnings }`; id mới cho custom/profile/stack, map lại ProfileId/RefId; KeepBoth thêm " (2)", Skip dùng mục sẵn có, Replace sửa tại chỗ; KHÔNG tự Save (bên gọi Save ToolStore + WorkspaceStore). Gói cũ: chỉ nhập tool + gắn vào workspace.
- P15: INVARIANT: manifest không chứa Workspace.Path/Id/Worktree/tác vụ/log; Cwd lệnh riêng tuyệt đối -> tương đối nếu trong gốc workspace, ngoài thì bỏ + cảnh báo. Tool pack=none/setup vẫn giữ path gốc như Packer cũ; Profile.Vals/Args không được lọc đường dẫn.
